mnemonic.content:
P - Position (Elevate head of bed to high-Fowler's to ease breathing and reduce preload);
O - Oxygen (Administer supplemental oxygen, typically high-flow via non-rebreather, to correct hypoxemia);
D - Diuretics (Administer loop diuretics, such as Furosemide IV, to reduce fluid overload and pulmonary congestion).
